    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1594">

                <pb facs="1332" n="1228" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1228"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 723.2515/277.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to Peru to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-11-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 27, 1912</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Brazil and Argentina having cabled approval Tacna-Arica settlement, President
                    Billinghurst asks if Department approves terms. Says such expression would
                    expedite congressional ratification.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Howard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
